			"Message": "docs(Project): Expand comprehensive documentation across all Element submodules\n\nMajor README expansion across all 15 Element submodules, reverting from benefit-focused condensed format to comprehensive technical documentation:\n- **Air, Mist**: Add architecture diagrams, usage code examples, system integration details\n- **Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove**: Expand with deep-dive sections, Mermaid diagrams, getting started guides\n- **Mountain, Rest, Output**: Add core architecture principles tables, project structure trees, development setup\n- **Vine**: Add protocol structure documentation, development status tracking table\n- **Wind**: Minify ESBuild configuration and clean compiled output (build artifact)\n- **Worker**: Add architecture diagram, dependency version updates (actions/setup-node, pnpm/action-setup)\n\nAlso delete `.README-TEMPLATE.md` - the centralized template is no longer needed as each submodule now has purpose-built documentation.\n\nThis provides developers with complete architectural context, API references, and integration paths across the entire Land editor component library.",
